  "rules": {
    "setup": "Geometry demonstration only. Apply the three-component proposal as a single assembly. The observatory stands west of the landing platform, joined by a bridge with matching walking-surface elevations. Each component contains editable primitive parts. Coordinates and dimensions use editor units.",
    "turns": "No turns or player actions. Edit parts to explore the architecture. Move all three components by the same offset to preserve their alignment.",
    "scoring": "No scoring, cards, pawns, dice, or resources.",
    "victory": "No victory condition. This is an architectural prototype, not a finished playable game."
